    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000ss03](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000ss03) Magnitude 5.7 earthquake at 343.313 depth occurred on Jun 10 2026 33 km ESE of Ol’ga, Russia. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 43.6289 longitude 135.6736. It impacted 4377 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
